        <mxCell id="NX" value="&lt;b&gt;After cementing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• edits to the default week: no effect&lt;br&gt;• alterations from the UI: refused&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Kacey chat: can amend&lt;/b&gt; the snapshot, and the previous version is kept for undo" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
